  "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
  "instance_name": "False_dichotomy",
  "label": "False Dichotomy",
  "description": "A logical fallacy that presents two opposing views as the only possibilities, ignoring other alternatives. The meme uses this by contrasting the 'insensitive' Muslim (top) with the 'overly emotional' Muslim (bottom), implying that Muslims must fall into one of these two categories when reacting to the Christchurch shootings. This is a key rhetorical device used to stereotype and demean Muslims.",
